    "detailed_description": "Soul Injector Commando is an action First Person Shooter. <br />\r\nGod has found a list of all the billionaires in the world and quickly discovers that they are the root of all the problems on Earth.<br />\r\nShe tasks you, a recently dead soul, to become the Soul Injector Commando.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nYou must go back down to Earth where God and some friends have built an elaborate bunker system where they have tricked the richest people on the planet to hide from a fake meteorite. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nTravel through 9 underground levels, injecting souls into all the wealthiest, most morally bankrupt people on Earth, making them become normal humans, get normal jobs, and be happy. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nFeatures:<br />\r\n-Many different weapons and upgrades<br />\r\n-Fully acted dialogue<br />\r\n-Time trials for level replayability<br />\r\n-Unique artwork, music and assets<br />\r\n-Save the world",
